591	    /**
592	     * Assigns the owner's {@code bulkSignupWarning} on create: {@code true} when more than
593	     * {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already carry this owner's (business-day
594	     * adjusted) {@code registrationDate}, otherwise {@code false}. The count is taken over the
595	     * existing owners before this one is persisted, so it reflects only the owners already
596	     * created for that day (matching the accumulation used by {@link #rejectDailyLimit}).
597	     *
